  "2": {
   "text": "The selected controls are tailored for each use case; organizations consider the need to further refine based on their own implementation.",
   "page": 3
  },
  "3": {
   "text": "The use cases has been updated from the Concept Paper to use a two use cases for both on-premises and third-party models and proprietary and public-facing input data instead of four.",
   "page": 3
  },
  "4": {
   "text": "Note that this is the narrative structure proposed for the NISTIR document series to facilitate ease of review and providing feedback. When the NISTIR series is finalized, the overlays will be released in different data formats to facilitate ease of use.",
   "page": 4
